<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">FORM WORKSPACE</text><view class="heading">草稿已整理，<view>最后由你把关。</view></view><view class="muted">根据材料自动匹配字段。未提供的信息保持为空。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card pulse">正在整理表单…</view><view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card"><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="field"><text class="field-label">{{item.key}} {{item.required?"*":"（选填）"}}</text><textarea wx:if="{{item.type==='multiline'}}" value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="change" maxlength="1000" placeholder="请补充并核对"/><input wx:else value="{{item.value}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="change" maxlength="500" placeholder="请补充并核对"/><view wx:if="{{item.error}}" class="error">{{item.error}}</view></view><view class="notice">确认后将保存本人核对的办理草稿，尚未提交给学校。</view><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{loading}}" loading="{{loading}}">确认表单并创建任务</button><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="copy">复制表单内容</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>